    "FuncDef": "The auto-frr command enables BGP Auto fast reroute (FRR).\nThe undo auto-frr command restores the default configuration.\nBy default, BGP Auto FRR is disabled.",
    "CLIs": [
        "auto-frr",
        "undo auto-frr"
