User Request:  
Hey, on a Nokia 7750 SR, how can I ensure that when my box gets BGP routes from an external neighbor, the very last AS number listed in the route’s AS trail is the same as the AS number I’ve set for that neighbor? Trying to stop cases where a peer might sneak in a mismatched AS at the end of the path.

