To configure your Nokia 7750 SR to prioritize BGP paths with the lowest total internal cost (including partner networks), enable the AIGP attribute on relevant BGP neighbors/groups. This attribute accumulates IGP metrics across ASes for end-to-end cost comparison:

```cli
configure router bgp
