### Notes:
- Replace `<group-name>`, `<ip-address>`, and `<limit>` with your specific neighbor details and prefix limit value.
- This configuration maintains IPv6 traffic flows by combining path redundancy (backup-path) with session persistence (graceful-restart) and error tolerance (prefix-limit log-only).
