To configure BGP on your Nokia 7750 SR to aggregate link capacity metrics for IPv4 routes from external peers, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group "YOUR_EBGP_GROUP_NAME"
        link-bandwidth
            aggregate-used-paths ipv4
        exit
    exit
```

**Key details:**
- Replace `"YOUR_EBGP_GROUP_NAME"` with your actual eBGP peer group name
- This configuration aggregates the bandwidth values from the `link-bandwidth` extended communities of multipaths for IPv4 routes
- The aggregated metrics enable improved load sharing across links when re-advertising routes with next-hop-self
