## Proposed answer:
To stop the routing process from considering IGP distance for BGP next-hop during best-path selection, configure the following:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        ignore-nh-metric
    exit
exit
```

This disables IGP metric comparison in BGP path selection, eliminating route flapping caused by IGP distance variations.
