To enable advertising alternate outbound paths for labeled IPv6 routes while preserving primary forwarding, configure BGP Add-Paths for labeled-unicast IPv6 with a send limit of 2 or higher at the desired BGP level (global, group, or neighbor):

```cli
configure router bgp
