**Key details:**
- `label-ipv6 send 2` advertises the best path plus one alternate path per prefix
- Replace `2` with a higher value (up to 16) to advertise more alternates
- Apply under `neighbor`, `group`, or global BGP context as needed
- Primary forwarding remains unchanged as only the best path is used locally

