    group "hub-group"
        cluster 192.168.10.1 orr-location 8 allow-local-fallback
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
1. Creates ORR location ID 8 under `optimal-route-reflection` to tag the hub group's location preference.  
2. Configures the hub group with:  
   - Route reflector cluster ID `192.168.10.1`  
   - ORR location binding `8`  
   - `allow-local-fallback` to use the router's local best path as backup when location-optimized paths are unavailable.  

**Note:** Replace `"hub-group"` with your actual BGP group name. Ensure IP reachability for the cluster ID (192.168.10.1) in your network.
