I’m setting up a Nokia 7750 SR in a multi-site setup where peers are spread across different DCs. For the BGP hub group, I need to assign the centralized reflector identifier as 192.168.10.1 and set the location-based preference tag to 8. How do I make sure the box uses the local exit as a backup when the best paths aren’t available?
