{'Parameters': 'allow-local-fallback', 'Info': 'Controls the behavior when there are no BGP routes to advertise to the RR clients that are reachable from the perspective of their ORR location. If this option is configured, the RR is allowed (in this circumstance only), to advertise the best reachable BGP path from its own topology location. If this option is not configured and this situation applies, then no route is advertised to the clients.'}
