To address the BGP route flapping issue while ensuring stable routes converge quickly, configure route damping with appropriate parameters. This suppresses unstable routes without significantly delaying stable route stabilization:

```
/configure router
    bgp
        damping "FIX-FLAP"
    exit
    policy-options
        begin
        policy-statement "FIX-FLAP"
            entry 10
                damping
                    half-life 15
