- `reuse 750`: Re-advertise route when penalty drops below 750  
- `suppress 3000`: Suppress route when penalty exceeds 3000  
- `max-suppress 60`: Maximum suppression time of 60 minutes  

Stable routes will reconverge normally, while flapping routes are temporarily suppressed based on their instability pattern. Monitor with `show router bgp routes damping` to fine-tune as needed.
