## Proposed answer:
To make the router immediately push known networks when the BGP peer link becomes active, use the `initial-send-delay-zero` command. Apply it at the appropriate configuration level (global BGP, group, or neighbor):

**Neighbor-level configuration:**  
```  
configure router bgp group <group_name> neighbor <neighbor_IP> initial-send-delay-zero  
```  

**Group-level configuration (applies to all neighbors in the group):**  
