User Request:  
Hey, on my Nokia 7750 SR, I need to make BGP sessions with cranky peers stay stable during maintenance reboots—how do I configure that feature where routes linger longer instead of immediately flapping when restarting? Some legacy boxes on the network can’t handle quick reconvergence.

