- Set resolution mode to `any` for both IPv4 and IPv6 families under `transport-tunnel`. This allows BGP to use all supported tunnel types in the TTM (Tunnel Table Manager) preference order for next-hop resolution.

If static routes are involved in resolving labeled next-hops, add this under `labeled-routes`:
```cli
allow-static
```

