To enable automatic TCP MTU adjustment using ICMP messages on your Nokia 7750 SR, use the following BGP configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    path-mtu-discovery
exit
```

This enables path MTU discovery for all BGP TCP sessions. The router will:
1. Set initial MTU to the egress interface's MTU
2. Set the DF (Don't Fragment) bit on packets
3. Dynamically adjust MTU based on ICMP "too big" messages from transit routers
4. Prevent mid-route fragmentation without manual MTU tuning

For granular control, apply this at specific levels:
- **Per neighbor**:  
