- The `route-table-import` command under `rib-management > ipv4` imports active IPv4 routes from the route table into BGP's RIB.
- The policy **core_routes** controls which routes are imported. Ensure this policy exists and matches the desired routes.
- BGP automatically uses these imported routes when advertising to neighbors configured in BGP groups. Verify your BGP export policies to confirm neighbors are allowed to receive these routes.
