To optimize BGP route reflection across multiple peer clusters on a Nokia 7750 SR and prevent bottlenecks or redundant chatter, use the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    split-horizon
    optimal-route-reflection
        location 1 primary-ip-address <ipv4-address>
