To debug unexpected BGP route behavior and view both original and policy-modified updates, configure BGP Monitoring Protocol (BMP) to capture pre-policy (original) and post-policy (modified) route monitoring messages. Use the following commands:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        monitor "debug-bmp"
