To configure BGP on your Nokia 7750 SR to advertise up to 8 label-encapsulated IPv4 routes for the same network and ensure the remote peer accepts multiple paths, use the following commands:

```cli
/configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    group "GROUP_NAME" 
        add-paths
            label-ipv4 send 8
        exit
    exit
exit
```

### Explanation:
1. **`multipath 8`**:  
